 390:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         bypassed without error reporting: it can be the intended behaviour in
 391:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         case of update of a parameter of ADC_InitTypeDef on the fly,
