2973:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Configure the analog watchdog.
2974:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   Possibility to update parameters on the fly:
