2982:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, analog watchdog thresholds can be modified
2983:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         while ADC conversion is on going.
